# Build context hygiene: keep host artifacts and secrets OUT of image layers.
# `.env*` is deliberately excluded — Vite vars arrive via Dockerfile ARGs
# (build args in compose), so the live DB password in .env never enters the
# builder layer and a clean clone builds with correct org settings.
node_modules
dist
.git
.github
.env
.env.production
*.log
.commandcode
.vscode